OL,3,GNEWSADivers explore mysteries of 14th
OL,4,ACentury lost town
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Those of us brought up in Cromer have
OL,7,Falways known the story of church rock,
OL,8,Fso it's a big step to saying the legend
OL,9,Fmay be incorrect," said Peter Stibbons,
OL,10,Fchairman of the Friends of Cromer
OL,11,FMuseum.
